  Name: Multimodal Transport Hub
  Type: 1
  Image: {fileID: 0}
  Description: The Multimodal Transport Hub must deliver a massive underground transit
    overhaul at Eindhoven Central Station to accommodate 150,000 daily commuters.
    The project shall relocate the current above-ground bus lanes into a subterranean
    terminal with 34 gates and five dedicated bus tunnels, removing large vehicles
    from street level. It must integrate a two-story indoor facility to add 7,900
    bicycle spaces, prioritizing eco-friendly travel and clear pedestrian spaces.
